","text":"永野さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハリウッドザコシショウさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムマシーン３号さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘンダーソンさん\n審査員には"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菊地亜美さんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中川家さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもスタジオが賑わい笑ってばかりの現場でした〜٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永野さんの真似を友達とやったりしてたし、\nよく学校でも「さいとうさんだぞ」って言ってたりしたので共演できて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘンダーソンさんの石焼イモのネタ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと初めて聞いたのですが\nメッッッチャ楽しいネタでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハリウッドザコシショウさんのお腹も可愛かったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムマシーン３号さんのなんでも太らせてしまうネタは最高でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで沢山笑った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前の東京ビッグサイトでの個別握手会！！！\n来てくださった方ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装はノギビンゴの妄想予選で着た服を着たよ〜٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部では左下の髪型をはじめてやった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つのがはえちゃったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プンプンッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ台湾や香港から来てくださったり、\n熊本県からもきてくださったり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ広島から来たよーとか！色んなところから来てくださって嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人を大切に、きっと乃木坂をやっていなかったら出会ってなかったんだなと思うとなんだかとてもあったかい気持ちになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/m